  "description": "TUnit-native text-snapshot assertions using [AssertionExtension]. Provides Assert.That(actual).MatchesSnapshot() / .MatchesSnapshotFile() with line-based diff display, accept-via-environment-variable workflow, and CI guard, and MatchesDocumentBlock() for a generated block between two marker lines of a document, such as a table in a Markdown file. Baselines are plain-text files at any path, so existing golden files work as they are. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no reflection. Designed for API-surface verification and small text snapshots; coexists with Verify for object-graph cases.",
  "id": "SnapshotAssertions.TUnit",
